10
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,980
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,020
=Episode 11=

12
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:16,000
Chu Li, she's here.

13
00:01:33,430 --> 00:01:34,710
(She's beautiful, as expected.)

14
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,640
(Beautiful indeed.)

15
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:41,790
(Not bad.)

16
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:49,760
Don't you think

17
00:01:49,870 --> 00:01:50,920
her hair

18
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,560
seems a little longer
than it did yesterday?

19
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,040
Yes.

20
00:01:55,950 --> 00:01:58,150
No normal person's hair
grows that fast in a day.

21
00:01:58,590 --> 00:01:59,790
Unless she really is a demon.

22
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:00,710
(Amazing.)

23
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:05,430
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

24
00:02:05,430 --> 00:02:07,349
(Amazing. Bravo!)

25
00:02:07,391 --> 00:02:10,010
♪Night dew cold♪

26
00:02:10,060 --> 00:02:10,890
Oh my.

27
00:02:12,730 --> 00:02:17,510
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

28
00:02:17,890 --> 00:02:20,820
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

29
00:02:21,530 --> 00:02:23,840
♪Yunmeng Marsh♪

30
00:02:31,910 --> 00:02:32,630
Chu Li,

31
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:33,840
her face...

32
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,910
With looks like that,

33
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,870
no wonder she wears a veil.

34
00:02:39,910 --> 00:02:41,150
Such a lovely voice,

35
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,560
wasted on a face like that.

36
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:47,400
(What a waste of my money.)

37
00:02:48,910 --> 00:02:50,310
(Come on, let's drink.)

38
00:02:52,750 --> 00:02:53,470
Go back first.

39
00:02:53,590 --> 00:02:54,310
I'll take a look.

40
00:02:54,430 --> 00:02:55,800
Be careful, Chu Li.

41
00:03:15,310 --> 00:03:16,680
Bring them to me,

42
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:19,400
and you'll have your looks back.

43
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,030
Who's there?

44
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:32,000
Miss Xizhao, I've come to see you.

45
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,750
And you are?

46
00:03:42,310 --> 00:03:43,080
I...

47
00:03:43,470 --> 00:03:44,960
I've admired you for a long time.

48
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:47,080
I heard today that you weren't well,

49
00:03:47,190 --> 00:03:48,120
so I came to visit.

50
00:03:51,470 --> 00:03:52,840
(Bring them to me,)

51
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,560
(and you'll have your looks back.)

52
00:04:04,190 --> 00:04:06,000
Thank you for your concern, sir.

53
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,310
You do

54
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,240
look somewhat familiar.

55
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,030
I...

56
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,160
I've always admired you,

57
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,040
so I came to visit.

58
00:04:18,510 --> 00:04:20,870
What seems to be ailing you?

59
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:22,800
I...

60
00:04:28,270 --> 00:04:30,630
You've come without attendants today?

61
00:04:31,190 --> 00:04:31,830
I...

62
00:04:31,950 --> 00:04:33,390
I came alone today.

63
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:37,000
If you don't mind,

64
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:39,070
why not come inside to talk?

65
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,680
Please excuse the mess.

66
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:55,680
I'll tidy up right away.

67
00:05:16,750 --> 00:05:17,560
This...

68
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:21,510
Is my wine not to your taste,

69
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:22,510
sir?

70
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,360
I just...

71
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:26,600
I can't hold my liquor.

72
00:05:30,390 --> 00:05:32,360
Miss Xizhao, your hair
flows like a waterfall.

73
00:05:32,950 --> 00:05:34,270
It's truly enchanting.

74
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:37,270
If you like it,

75
00:05:37,950 --> 00:05:39,800
why not feel it for yourself?

76
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,040
Sir,

77
00:05:46,630 --> 00:05:47,630
why not

78
00:05:48,190 --> 00:05:50,070
stay for the night?

79
00:06:04,870 --> 00:06:05,489
Diviner Song?

80
00:06:05,531 --> 00:06:06,190
You...

81
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:18,310
What are you doing?

82
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,750
Didn't I tell you to leave Jinan City?

83
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:25,190
Diviner Song, aren't you overstepping?

84
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,560
Whether I leave the city is my business.

85
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:28,630
But you...

86
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,430
How did you know I was here?

87
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:31,779
I thought some lecher

88
00:06:31,821 --> 00:06:32,870
had entered Xizhao's room.

89
00:06:33,190 --> 00:06:34,160
So it was you.

90
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:38,240
You came for Xizhao?

91
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,190
I see.

92
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,680
I guess

93
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,720
I've ruined your good time,
Diviner Song.

94
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:47,120
My apologies.

95
00:06:47,830 --> 00:06:48,480
Exactly.

96
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,240
Then don't come here again.

97
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,680
None of your business.

98
00:06:52,070 --> 00:06:52,750
Chu Li,

99
00:06:53,310 --> 00:06:54,120
are you all right?

100
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,310
I'm fine. Never better.

101
00:06:57,510 --> 00:06:59,870
Since you're free today,
how about a stroll with me?

102
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:01,950
Sure, Chu Li.

103
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:03,600
Wherever you want to go,
I'll go with you.

104
00:07:03,750 --> 00:07:04,310
Let's go.

105
00:07:06,870 --> 00:07:07,920
We're going to
that place we went last time.

106
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:08,680
Really?

107
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,579
You loved that place.

108
00:07:10,621 --> 00:07:11,270
It was so fun.

109
00:07:11,390 --> 00:07:12,040
Yes.

110
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,680
We played with pinwheels last time.

111
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,480
(Xizhao is up to no good.)

112
00:07:15,750 --> 00:07:17,240
(I need to find a way to test her.)

113
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,160
I was so close.

114
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,950
Just one step away.

115
00:07:47,630 --> 00:07:48,190
Chu Li,

116
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,430
where are we actually going?

117
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,560
Nowhere.

118
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:52,390
Chu Li,

119
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:54,600
why were you with Diviner Song earlier?

120
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:56,600
Did you two have a fight?

121
00:07:57,190 --> 00:07:58,480
Can you stop asking?

122
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:14,940
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

123
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:18,250
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

124
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:23,050
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

125
00:08:23,900 --> 00:08:26,720
♪Vows sink deep♪

126
00:08:27,670 --> 00:08:32,770
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

127
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:37,570
♪Covering the realm♪

128
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,390
I'm honored, Diviner Song.

129
00:08:52,150 --> 00:08:53,360
I'd like to

130
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,790
stay by your side from now on.

131
00:09:02,910 --> 00:09:03,670
Get out.

132
00:09:05,750 --> 00:09:06,510
What?

133
00:09:06,790 --> 00:09:09,870
You don't want my company, Diviner Song?

134
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,270
No.

135
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,000
But I

136
00:09:17,510 --> 00:09:19,240
don't want to leave.

137
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,870
(Same smell as that shriveled corpse.)

138
00:09:45,910 --> 00:09:47,030
(Could this demon survive)

139
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:49,030
(by feeding on human blood essence?)

140
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,200
(Then Song Ziyuan must be...)

141
00:09:56,390 --> 00:09:57,870
Why should I care if he lives or dies?

142
00:09:58,550 --> 00:09:59,790
What if he doesn't need saving?

143
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,790
I'd only be humiliating myself.

144
00:10:11,630 --> 00:10:12,550
The lamp is going out.

145
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:16,840
Song Ziyuan,

146
00:10:17,390 --> 00:10:18,840
if I weren't trying to become
Grand Shaman,

147
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,270
I wouldn't save you at all.

148
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:32,390
Stop struggling.

149
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,270
I'm not

150
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,870
letting you escape today!

151
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,000
Is that all you've got?

152
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,240
Song Ziyuan,

153
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:13,550
you can't die.

154
00:11:24,150 --> 00:11:25,510
The moment you men

155
00:11:25,910 --> 00:11:28,320
see a beautiful woman,
you're consumed by lust.

156
00:11:28,670 --> 00:11:29,870
Fickle and faithless.

157
00:11:29,870 --> 00:11:31,270
You don't deserve to live.

158
00:11:43,870 --> 00:11:44,670
Song Ziyuan!

159
00:11:46,270 --> 00:11:47,080
Guard the lamp.

160
00:11:48,270 --> 00:11:50,030
Another one just walked right in!

161
00:11:50,550 --> 00:11:51,480
Today,

162
00:11:51,750 --> 00:11:53,320
you'll both die together.

163
00:12:10,270 --> 00:12:11,320
You've possessed a human body.

164
00:12:11,550 --> 00:12:12,630
Now get out!

165
00:12:13,390 --> 00:12:14,480
Why did you come back,

166
00:12:14,870 --> 00:12:15,670
Chu Li?

167
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,030
Even if you're going to die,

168
00:12:17,270 --> 00:12:18,630
you can only die by my hand.

169
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:55,720
Master!

170
00:12:56,270 --> 00:12:56,960
I'm sorry.

171
00:12:57,150 --> 00:12:58,480
I lost track of the demon.

172
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:00,240
Master!

173
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:01,750
Shiqi, leave us.

174
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:02,720
I'll save him.

175
00:13:06,630 --> 00:13:07,360
Song Ziyuan.

176
00:13:08,750 --> 00:13:09,720
Li.

177
00:13:11,910 --> 00:13:12,720
Song Ziyuan!

178
00:13:14,270 --> 00:13:15,150
(Song Ziyuan,)

179
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:17,600
(why do you push me away
again and again,)

180
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,670
(only to shield me again and again?)

181
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:27,270
Miss Chu Li,

182
00:13:27,510 --> 00:13:28,670
how is my master?

183
00:13:30,030 --> 00:13:30,750
He'll live.

184
00:13:31,030 --> 00:13:31,750
Don't worry.

185
00:13:33,270 --> 00:13:34,320
That's great. What a relief.

186
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:36,489
Why weren't you there the moment

187
00:13:36,531 --> 00:13:37,670
he was in danger?

188
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:39,480
If it weren't for me,

189
00:13:39,910 --> 00:13:40,870
he'd be dead.

190
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:44,080
Master ordered me
to guard you in secret,

191
00:13:44,390 --> 00:13:45,150
so

192
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:47,200
I didn't make it back in time
to protect Master.

193
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,150
Song Ziyuan

194
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:51,200
told you to protect me?

195
00:13:53,030 --> 00:13:54,080
How could that be?

196
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,790
More like he sent you to spy on me.

197
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:59,670
He was probably afraid
I'd cause him trouble.

198
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:01,790
Master told me

199
00:14:02,030 --> 00:14:03,480
to protect you

200
00:14:03,910 --> 00:14:06,360
and do my best to keep anyone
from giving you a hard time.

201
00:14:07,870 --> 00:14:09,080
What is Song Ziyuan

202
00:14:09,910 --> 00:14:11,080
playing at?

203
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:15,080
Take Xizhao to the dungeon.

204
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,120
I need to question her.

205
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,790
That demon can possess you,

206
00:14:25,790 --> 00:14:27,600
but she doesn't take over your mind,

207
00:14:28,030 --> 00:14:28,630
right?

208
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:33,910
She must've been draining
your vital essence for a long time.

209
00:14:35,670 --> 00:14:36,960
Forget about your looks.

210
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:39,080
You only have

211
00:14:39,750 --> 00:14:40,910
a few days left to live.

212
00:14:43,200 --> 00:14:44,630
Do you care more about your life?

213
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:48,270
Or your face?

214
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:56,480
Can you... Can you save me?

215
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,120
Then you need to find a way

216
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:02,000
to help me lure that demon out.

217
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:14,430
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

218
00:15:16,050 --> 00:15:21,510
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

219
00:15:23,130 --> 00:15:26,360
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

220
00:15:26,530 --> 00:15:29,840
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

221
00:15:29,970 --> 00:15:35,750
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

222
00:15:37,210 --> 00:15:42,430
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

223
00:15:44,290 --> 00:15:50,480
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

224
00:15:50,730 --> 00:15:54,240
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

225
00:15:54,290 --> 00:15:57,579
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

226
00:15:57,621 --> 00:16:04,560
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

227
00:16:04,810 --> 00:16:08,120
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

228
00:16:08,450 --> 00:16:12,360
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

229
00:16:12,410 --> 00:16:18,720
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

230
00:16:47,790 --> 00:16:54,579
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

231
00:16:54,621 --> 00:17:00,800
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
